{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n\n<p>發佈時間：21:10 2026-10-18 HKT</p>\n<p>網上今日（18日）流傳一段中年漢逃避食環署人員執法的短片。片段長約11秒，未有交代事件發生的確實時間。片中見到一名身穿黑衣的男子在屯門街頭被食環署人員截查，其間該名男子趁食環署人員不為意時，突然拔腿狂奔，並衝出馬路逃遁。食環署人員隨即尾隨，並大聲喝令「唔好走！企喺度！」，惟男子未有理會，成功逃到對面馬路，影片至此結束。</p>\n<p>上載片段的網民指，該名男子隨處丟煙頭，之後情緒激動向食環署人員解釋，聲稱附近沒有垃圾桶才會亂拋垃圾。不過多名網民認為，影片清楚拍低該名黑衣男子的容貌，基本上插翼難飛，「走都冇用啦！俾人拍晒片，有人臉識別，一定捉得返」、「如果報警，佢應該走唔甩」、「走得甩咩，拉到仲告多條罪！」。《星島頭條》正向食環署查詢事件。</p>\n<img alt=\"一名身穿黑衣的男子在屯門街頭被食環署人員截查。網上片段截圖\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b7eaf692112cd28793560bc6b7048f31/2026-10/AQMkxOvFGTRcZi8MYMRw_PzCYuj4stYOAwbAWvobYbZEUTDu46zPJyy3d3RLB5Ew6rs3WJ9GmmlBJLn77elu6tcJZHGHpg8jHxRXTHSdPGqrmg_1_mp4_snapshot_00_00_271.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"男子趁食環署人員不為意時，突然拔腿狂奔，並衝出馬路。網上片段截圖\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/a693114992643728e351668346384403/2026-10/AQMkxOvFGTRcZi8MYMRw_PzCYuj4stYOAwbAWvobYbZEUTDu46zPJyy3d3RLB5Ew6rs3WJ9GmmlBJLn77elu6tcJZHGHpg8jHxRXTHSdPGqrmg_1_mp4_snapshot_00_02_577.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"食環署人員隨即尾隨，並大聲喝令「唔好走！企喺度！」網上片段截圖\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/8762abb3ceefa7c6922017bf8792e3e3/2026-10/AQMkxOvFGTRcZi8MYMRw_PzCYuj4stYOAwbAWvobYbZEUTDu46zPJyy3d3RLB5Ew6rs3WJ9GmmlBJLn77elu6tcJZHGHpg8jHxRXTHSdPGqrmg_1_mp4_snapshot_00_03_820.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"男子衝出馬路。網上片段截圖\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/050f3bbc3a87cad3500025e96cbbee4a/2026-10/AQMkxOvFGTRcZi8MYMRw_PzCYuj4stYOAwbAWvobYbZEUTDu46zPJyy3d3RLB5Ew6rs3WJ9GmmlBJLn77elu6tcJZHGHpg8jHxRXTHSdPGqrmg_1_mp4_snapshot_00_06_420.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"男子衝出馬路。網上片段截圖\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/885bfd4d6219f0decc4e85e5b42fb097/2026-10/AQMkxOvFGTRcZi8MYMRw_PzCYuj4stYOAwbAWvobYbZEUTDu46zPJyy3d3RLB5Ew6rs3WJ9GmmlBJLn77elu6tcJZHGHpg8jHxRXTHSdPGqrmg_1_mp4_snapshot_00_07_935.jpg\"/>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-18T13:18:44.348178+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":342,"images":5,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-18T13:10:47+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-18T14:38:04.517942+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-18T13:17:35.271576+00:00","content_hash":"e5b3f1ef3bc50e1aa033966942e1d88e3b91ff21a6cdb0eddd75c7b6d14502f8","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}